    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scribble Wolf</strong> is a Werewolf game (or social deduction game), in which you can control the character that you have drawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/b40cd12b7bf2afa806b57a7d4699bcb7.poster.avif?t=1755463171\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/b40cd12b7bf2afa806b57a7d4699bcb7.webm?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/b40cd12b7bf2afa806b57a7d4699bcb7.mp4?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle will be divided into the Townsfolks team and the Werewolves team. However, Townsfolks don\u2019t know who their fellows are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/c375bc5b2ef189d0da2545f2bc5bd845.poster.avif?t=1755463171\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/c375bc5b2ef189d0da2545f2bc5bd845.webm?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/c375bc5b2ef189d0da2545f2bc5bd845.mp4?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Werewolves do: Disguise yourself as a Townsfolk and kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/976957f4552c0bb0a09b68998b3b46ca.poster.avif?t=1755463171\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/976957f4552c0bb0a09b68998b3b46ca.webm?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/976957f4552c0bb0a09b68998b3b46ca.mp4?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Townsfolks do: Find the Werewolves who is sneaking among the players and kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/f33e7697d53cb7d65a4facd9c4e89504.poster.avif?t=1755463171\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/f33e7697d53cb7d65a4facd9c4e89504.webm?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/f33e7697d53cb7d65a4facd9c4e89504.mp4?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversations with other players can only be done by handwriting. (When Disguising, imitate its handwriting as well.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/f0f02c7b86ae26acdd0c1477cec7b2ae.poster.avif?t=1755463171\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/f0f02c7b86ae26acdd0c1477cec7b2ae.webm?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/f0f02c7b86ae26acdd0c1477cec7b2ae.mp4?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of items to lead your team to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/fb599c884ae99bb884cbb77959ec7646.poster.avif?t=1755463171\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/fb599c884ae99bb884cbb77959ec7646.webm?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/fb599c884ae99bb884cbb77959ec7646.mp4?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room Creation</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 10 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public / Private setting</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Rule Settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mosaic button&quot; for when something suspicious appears</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/ec20d87af659f9ae1187afa7172e428d.poster.avif?t=1755463171\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/ec20d87af659f9ae1187afa7172e428d.webm?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539320/extras/ec20d87af659f9ae1187afa7172e428d.mp4?t=1755463171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guideline:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is OK for individuals / corporations</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is OK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permission is not required</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you put a link to this page in the description or something, I\u2019m HAPPY</p></li></ul>",
